      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## 🚦 Status Overview\nOne landing page for **what the backend has been doing** — data ingests, availability polls, and watches — newest first. Click a row's linked cell to **drill into the detail dashboards**, or use a run's **Logs** link to scope the backend log panel at the bottom (sets the `log_filter` variable to that run id)."
      }
